# Claude Code
# The shared configuration — CLAUDE.md, .claude/agents, .claude/skills,
# .claude/hooks, .claude/settings.json and .mcp.json — IS committed on purpose:
# it is what makes an agent session reproducible for the next person. Only the
# per-developer overrides and the session scratch stay out.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.session/

# Phase 7. gen-l10n writes it on every `pub get`; it is a build report,
# not source. Empty when the ARBs are in parity.
l10n_untranslated.json
